ed_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-02T12:30:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:40:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.8.dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev7 - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 60.04 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1235U (12 threads) - 7.48 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\ndraw_polyline()'s documentation promise is: \"Draws interconnected line segments with a uniform width...\". But you can easily not get uniform width, if your angles are even slightly sharp. Here's an example: \n\n<img width=\"382\" height=\"212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3d5a02a-57fe-4396-b00b-f051455a2d6f\" />\n\n<img width=\"647\" height=\"438\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a834257-87a9-4154-9e4f-6b6618c2fb1e\" />\n\nThis affects also draw_polyline_colors(), and surely also the corresponding RenderingServer method.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n   draw_polyline(PackedVector2Array([Vector2(16, 16), Vector2(128, 32), Vector2(40, 40)]), Color.BLACK, 3.0, true)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCould make one if necessary.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124090/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124090/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}